  "ruleText": "He-C 209.02 Contents of Explanation. The commissioner shall provide a written response, which complies with the requirements of RSA 541-A: 11, VII.\n\nSource. #6986, eff 4-24-99; ss by #8866-B, eff 4-13-07",
